            "notes": [
                {
                    "category": "summary",
                    "text": "NVIDIA DeepStream  contains a vulnerability where an attacker could cause an integer overflow by supplying crafted tensor dimensions in a YAML configuration file. A successful exploit of this vulnerability might lead to denial of service, information disclosure, data tampering.",
